        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Heading" table:number-columns-spanned="8" office:value-type="string"><text:p>As at 24 September 2026, on the term sheet’s numbers</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="7"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rh1_0"><table:table-cell table:style-name="NoteWrap" table:number-columns-spanned="8" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Prepared by Ines Kowalczyk, Chief Executive. Blue figures are inputs; the rest are worked out. Percentages are fully diluted: every option, granted or not, counts as a share.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="7"/></table:table-row>
