        <table:table-row table:style-name="rh0_6"><table:table-cell table:style-name="NoteWrap" table:number-columns-spanned="8" office:value-type="string"><text:p>1.  The ordinary shares and the option pool agree with the register of members and the share option plan: 9,000,000 shares in issue and 1,000,000 options.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="7"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rh0_6"><table:table-cell table:style-name="NoteWrap" table:number-columns-spanned="8" office:value-type="string"><text:p>2.  Of the 1,000,000 options in the pool, 640,000 are granted and 360,000 are not yet allocated.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="7"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rh0_6"><table:table-cell table:style-name="NoteWrap" table:number-columns-spanned="8" office:value-type="string"><text:p>3.  Merrowdown Ventures LLP invests £3,000,000 for 1,875,000 shares and Pellridge Capital Partners LP £1,000,000 for 625,000 shares, both at £1.60.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="7"/></table:table-row>
